      "trackName": "Ninja Air Hockey",
      "description": "EATURES\n• Singleplayer: Play against AI with 3 difficulty levels (Easy, Normal, Hard)\n• Local Multiplayer: Play with a friend on the same device\n• Online Multiplayer: Create a room, share the code, and play against anyone\n• Touch controls: Drag your paddle with your finger\n• Haptic feedback on every hit and goal\n• No accounts, no ads, no in-app purchases — just play\n\nHOW TO PLAY\nSlide your paddle to hit the puck into your opponent's goal. First to reach the score limit wins. It's that simple.\n\nONLINE PLAY\nTap \"Online Multiplayer\", create a room, and share the 4-character code with your opponent via WhatsApp, Signal, or any other way. No account needed.",
